{"metadata":{"name":"Sahih Muslim","section":{"16":{"eng-name":"The Book of Marriage","ara-name":"كتاب النكاح"}},"section_detail":{"16":{"hadithnumber_first":388,"hadithnumber_last":3567,"arabicnumber_first":1400.01,"arabicnumber_last":1443}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3552,"arabicnumber":"1438.09","text":"Rapporté par Ma’bad ibn Sirin : Il a demandé à Abu Sa'id رضي الله عنه : As-tu entendu le Messager d’Allah ﷺ dire quelque chose au sujet de l’azl ? Il a répondu : « Oui. » (Le reste du hadith est le même)","grades":[{"name":"Imam Muslim","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":16,"hadith":154},"chapter":{"id":22,"ara-name":"باب حُكْمِ الْعَزْلِ ","eng-name":"The ruling on coitus interrupts ('Azl)","isFirstHadith":false}}]}